WEBVTT

00:00:00.180 --> 00:00:00.740
Esta máscara

00:00:00.740 --> 00:00:01.720
esconde un plan

00:00:01.720 --> 00:00:03.540
explosivo.

00:00:03.540 --> 00:00:04.360
Londres,

00:00:04.360 --> 00:00:05.460
1605.

00:00:05.460 --> 00:00:05.920
Hartos de la

00:00:05.920 --> 00:00:06.380
persecución

00:00:06.380 --> 00:00:07.500
religiosa, unos

00:00:07.500 --> 00:00:08.100
conspiradores

00:00:08.100 --> 00:00:09.000
católicos querían

00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:10.020
matar al rey y

00:00:10.020 --> 00:00:11.440
volar el parlamento.

00:00:11.440 --> 00:00:12.200
Guy Fawkes

00:00:12.200 --> 00:00:12.820
custodiaba

00:00:12.820 --> 00:00:14.140
36

00:00:14.140 --> 00:00:15.660
barriles de pólvora,

00:00:15.660 --> 00:00:16.780
pero una carta de

00:00:16.780 --> 00:00:17.980
aviso desató la

00:00:17.980 --> 00:00:18.540
búsqueda.

00:00:18.540 --> 00:00:19.440
Lo atraparon antes

00:00:19.440 --> 00:00:20.620
de la explosión y

00:00:20.620 --> 00:00:21.780
acabó ejecutado.

00:00:21.780 --> 00:00:23.000
El plan fracasó.

00:00:23.000 --> 00:00:24.400
Siglos después, V.

00:00:24.400 --> 00:00:24.800
de Vendetta

00:00:24.800 --> 00:00:25.940
convirtió su rostro

00:00:25.940 --> 00:00:26.940
en símbolo de

00:00:26.940 --> 00:00:27.720
rebelión.

00:00:27.720 --> 00:00:28.840
La pólvora no

00:00:28.840 --> 00:00:29.180
estalló.

00:00:29.180 --> 00:00:30.920
La máscara sí dio

00:00:30.920 --> 00:00:32.100
la vuelta al mundo.

00:00:32.300 --> 00:00:33.280
Suscríbete.
